        // L3 norm of [-1, 2, -2] = (|−1|³+|2|³+|−2|³)^(1/3) = 17^(1/3) ≈ 2.5713 — finite, no NaN.
        // (Without abs, (-1)³+2³+(-2)³ = -1 then (-1)^(1/3) = NaN.)
